# LoomSet

LoomSet is a lightweight dataset-generation pipeline that takes a search query, collects candidate URLs, extracts clean text, filters and labels it, and exports a Hugging Face dataset plus parquet artifact.

## Quick start

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e .
loomset run --query "solar-punk urban planning" --max-results 5
```

This MVP is intentionally simple and resumable; it stores pipeline state in SQLite and produces artifacts under `data/`.
